<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3461936876845762547..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: A &quot;Cunning&quot; Plan, A Wrongfully Convicted Man</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>6</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8474750111073817526</id><published>2007-11-14T23:38:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-14T23:38:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Sure you can, Brian. It is the same mindset that r...</title><content type='html'>Sure you can, Brian. It is the same mindset that recognizable criminals have.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/8474750111073817526'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/8474750111073817526'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html?showComment=1195108680000#c8474750111073817526' title=''/><author><name>straightarrow</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3461936876845762547' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3461936876845762547' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 14, 2007 at 11:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5573627344256476975</id><published>2007-11-13T13:12:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-13T13:12:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I can understand, somewhat, making a mistake like ...</title><content type='html'>I can understand, somewhat, making a mistake like Broderick did.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;But then, when you are presented with such strong evidence that you were wrong, not admitting it when someone is in jail for your mistake?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;That, I can&#39;t understand.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/5573627344256476975'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/5573627344256476975'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html?showComment=1194984720000#c5573627344256476975' title=''/><author><name>Brian</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17387233246665688430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='32' src='http://www.whatreallyhappened.com/IMAGES/aaaab.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3461936876845762547' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3461936876845762547' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-623565012"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 13, 2007 at 1:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8487803933050359983</id><published>2007-11-12T21:00:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-12T21:00:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>and I&#39;ll just bet the new prosecutors can come up ...</title><content type='html'>and I&#39;ll just bet the new prosecutors can come up with all sorts of reasons the miscreants who committed a fraud upon the court and the jury and crimes against the defendant cannot now be tried for their crimes.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;These are the people who want us disarmed. Is it any wonder?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/8487803933050359983'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/8487803933050359983'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html?showComment=1194926400000#c8487803933050359983' title=''/><author><name>straightarrow</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3461936876845762547' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3461936876845762547' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 12, 2007 at 9:00 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-775547001553980596</id><published>2007-11-12T14:54:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-12T14:54:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I shudder to think what would happen to me in this...</title><content type='html'>I shudder to think what would happen to me in this day and age if I were a young kid in school. I drew some pretty violent and macabre things when I was a kid, particularly in junior high. It&#39;s fairly typical.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/775547001553980596'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/775547001553980596'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html?showComment=1194904440000#c775547001553980596' title=''/><author><name>Al Newberry</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12702350396853727859</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3461936876845762547' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3461936876845762547' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2027341530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 12, 2007 at 2:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6237654809513070041</id><published>2007-11-12T13:08:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-12T13:08:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>When your peers are unprincipled leftists, not gov...</title><content type='html'>When your peers are unprincipled leftists, not governed by a moral compass- the worst can happen as in this case and in countless others.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;No wonder King David after his sin of numbering his people; when given the choice of falling into the hands of his peers or the hands of Almighty God for judgment; King David wiseley chose to trust in Almighty God, because God is merciful and His judgment is righteous. He knew how vicious and corrupt man is.,,</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/6237654809513070041'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/6237654809513070041'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html?showComment=1194898080000#c6237654809513070041' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3461936876845762547' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3461936876845762547' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 12, 2007 at 1:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5754622060016049683</id><published>2007-11-12T08:56:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-11-12T08:56:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Perhaps if the federal government had  followed it...</title><content type='html'>Perhaps if the federal government had  followed its constitutional mandate of not getting involved in domestic law enforcement of this type, the whole mess would never have happened. That he was convicted by the drawings is not a surprise to me. For some time now, it has been the policy of social engineers, especially engineeresses, to suspend or expel little boys from school for drawing guns or the trade center on fire, and requiring psycho-analysis for criminal acts such as titty twisters. In one case from Seattle that I remember reading, a kid had to describe his &quot;thinking errors&quot; that led to giving his friend, a male, a titty twister. Nothing terrifies me more than being tried by my &quot;peers.&quot; Then again, I don&#39;t have any better ideas.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/5754622060016049683'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3461936876845762547/comments/default/5754622060016049683'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html?showComment=1194882960000#c5754622060016049683' title=''/><author><name>Zachary</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05334525584242029389</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/11/cunning-plan-wrongfully-convicted-man.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3461936876845762547' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3461936876845762547' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-995279443"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 12, 2007 at 8:56 AM"/></entry></feed>